{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1587,
  "batch_count": 1700,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "dee43784390e4551565b4149c73094c85eded86d",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbf71803f7e2f5f20f735122",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在食堂里，我和坐在旁边座位的\n孩子聊了起来…那是一段愉快到\n差点忘了吃饭的时光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5cc909e613804dd4612cf8fc85ba301544650fee40784ecfa3165bfa7f99a26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de5a329985cbf8a63d141418",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在想要不要邀请玫瑰同学\n去吃烤肉卷摊。味道稍微浓郁些，\n但我想她会觉得很新鲜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a058cf992d7e9b93c90813869ff5779fdeb6a8e712c53e1153e5c6cb5ede8118",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80802bc404ab8ea78ae9469e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到大家解出难题时的\n笑容，我就很开心。\n今天也要一起开学习会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85fc332995cb96fc6725e3377503c729a78d3c001b0f55283c45b3bd8d63bfec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b03624c40eaf3299160e45f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "睡前，我会翻开最喜欢的画集。\n看着美丽的画作，心也仿佛\n静静地安宁下来…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8af1b8cca320b6e3676d60e805203549caf278f099a61c4698a20bd0a6bac2f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8faf10de60ca964a21c39ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很多孩子会对新环境感到困惑…\n所以我会主动和她们说话，聊聊花。\n希望她们能稍微抬起头向前走。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1413332c5d99bd15fa0b6576a7818f39d95b2a82176a4c8be14d4c5e61fbcb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66244f11a914890f09e4ba90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "蛇形烟花，真是不可思议呢…。\n黑色的弯曲痕迹像要形成圆环，\n却又没有形成…莫名让人印象深刻…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "feb0c779213bd132661c01daa4dfae1c53136857429b456d97da9df46d26217e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08a6f25b96616f918510ec20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "前阵子，万籁争鸣同学\n邀请我去听音乐会…呵呵。好像是\n为了感谢我介绍推荐的画展。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d278a3515d3bb4407ac4cae87aff23917d938a2f22ea7107f2b7c0ffa4972c72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea2cfc3756d9908da1732ed0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天时，我们一家人常常围着\n壁炉的火。被同一团火焰温暖着，\n感觉心也会变得温暖…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d513b58103795fa414ddb0df5c7380b06e662d685daf55cc8310864f8faef3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7073ce637bb7c12d1166679b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "84545e9d062a703e60cf0240a4c6690b3f86c69931c0b8d072086c92aed0b29d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a805bc79bcec1e4b237a263b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "万籁争鸣同学的音乐，总是让我的心\n雀跃不已。昨晚我们也一边护理尾巴，\n一边一起哼着歌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e56dd1a47c9542c8755b0391260e5a25f1116b00c0fc9384e597e4a05cd5268d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31fd41dd1f23fbf2a679efce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到没有插上的插头，\n我总会忍不住在意。\n总觉得它看起来有些寂寞…",
      "source_fingerprint": "860e2b3d3c22b293770373f404a8318de2f80dd7d2a71d1f96a4ced89ad67e0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82efb5ac05e886c71d2a8602",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我经常和在法国留学的朋友\n视频通话。每次都聊得很开心，\n让人感觉不到距离呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21bcc23049ef2daa9fc67ad48178f5d3cbe96f61a178ad028fc7954cc401b4d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6073aba693c9b835849ed1fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在宝石之中，绿松石尤其会\n夺走我的心。那鲜明的水蓝色，\n总会让我不由得看入迷…",
      "source_fingerprint": "5964a51af13f077e4a06dc1b7f55a608987f436dfad3db30ecb5f424dffc6bcd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35cd72713c2cc53db357e5cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "袜子我总是会先用夹子夹住\n再收起来。要是只剩下一只，\n就太可怜了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ce15feaeaa3fae4f04ee9e608f344766e90a7921d2230d46ab6dd6752710db7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:594f2e96b88bd78d5e49a5c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "舞蹈课程非常开心。\n大家配合动作时，\n感觉连心也合而为一了…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee9f34b662ff810cfa9aa0fd02f3eecf26a59a33df8812387803bea24c82cb57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb07d5ba88516e8ea7416c89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想用歌声和舞蹈传达。\n愿无论何时，大家都能拥有\n想起笑容的瞬间——",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a0ad9fc8fef5e6d38eb73d84754bcb5362c711b71c1e47039a2231bb6aa949e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7574aec7d9850795a704a943",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我向这身衣装的纯白——起誓。\n我会继续前行，送去洁白闪耀的希望，\n让自己能陪伴每一个人的心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9430eaf49abe2769cd015a10d49d2061b8e521a347924235fa24dc4aadeaea37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f994e6af24e29a7d930c4761",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这顶帽子，采用了和我小时候戴过的\n那顶一样的设计。\n这样过去的朋友也能立刻认出我——",
      "source_fingerprint": "accba87044512b312c3622cb0d212472f895913b453bcbc32754564b58f2404b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:817c804f6703ed910738941d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上梳理尾巴的时候…我会忍不住\n把尾巴尖打个结，做成一个圆环。\n总会稍微玩一下呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "714754b565a4b3d9924d8e5fbba425de95aaf3ec88cc64af17ff8e97316b9cd7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20d5c68b40ba123aed6aa941",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "统治地位同学的战略…简直像美丽的\n数学公式一样。下一局盘面上，\n会看到怎样的发展呢，我很期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f5640e22a4fb89e78b358fecc4f5fab23fd9254e1cc49e4075081f7a0d34304",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cc79e0ffaa31053f498970e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想通过比赛与你连结，\n与你。\n然后——与全世界的人连结。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b0e3bf7755f0c6014a51892d70990dcf0c0727d6898a04713cb0e56d50d530c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34947fb0d7bf4da903396da9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜宵要不要来一份鲭鱼三明治？\n虽然简单，却有种让人上瘾的味道，\n从小时候起我就很喜欢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "86e9469ed1db2278cecd6f61121dc8126c7e7f890a9459eb93f46fbea0b5751b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fe3bc763d7b1fabf7823354",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赏花会让心变得温暖呢。\n在樱花树下，大家一同欢笑的\n时光…真的非常美好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e28b935d414b5dcc543f306cb87617cd60d5321bd809b0b90b2089be049d4270",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:068d2bdc0b5dfbc89e560372",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "蝉鸣声，很好听呢。\n就像是在有限的时间里竭尽全力，\n歌唱生命的喜悦一样…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b59dd6dafe13c96e3392f682b3fa591a93e169a68eee4032bf5c7999089b6e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3622ab10b1c31c666de933b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学校活动里常看到的班级T恤\n…很棒呢。穿着同样的心意，\n就像大家的心连在一起一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2af9f3ca752d755b2cdb8a90af169a21bcc112e5bf48364c20bf6744fe09c557",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b2372af6453ea77705eacb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "编织真美好呢。\n线与线相互结起，竟然就能做出\n温暖某个人的东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aab8ea5912f918f4ee9da08cf821f5726e18f74ceb38c6de6e7d656a89fc615b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f048509da76d1ed759cc8a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多亏有你支持，\n今天我也能专心锻炼了。\n请多关照。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14f9cc84a239c50f13ce919abac549a7bbd662ad537cda72bb27d189f9786dd2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71d8e76b99d4b547c754affe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "器材都准备好了吗？\n如果需要帮忙的话，\n请不用客气地告诉我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7b40d6f23960269b7f3177c03912d195769d3faecaf8881e4fdca2719b5b81d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5647647b635a2fc7f1792945",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论怎样的训练\n都没问题哦。\n别看我这样，其实我很结实的哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "46170802468310fd9f9c64acba2d758158f181a2e5d86a5aba1670db3fc2c326",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:746491d98898ff4775b071e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算不说出口，我也能感受到。\n在这里努力的大家，心中怀抱着\n多么强烈的意志…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2282b0f6e91eac0214026889413de74b4f471a4cb7467b848cf5a4aca744fd1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6593adf50b20040093c74273",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还想再稍微伸展一下身体。\n如果可以的话，能请你看看\n我的拉伸姿势吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "082e8ae8055f4ee93fcd2292f64fd12c7c55b8011d18299bb88b19ce7bd186af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0cf29831a6159083f2f55d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一想到与你一同编织的日子，\n终有一天会成为照亮某个人的光…\n心中就变得炽热起来呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62968656b39c8150ba094b8ca39841801c29e3fa316febfa92cbd1345ab6ac43",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c74cac54bb5da739f30c8ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使在连结起全世界的心，\n治愈所有孤独之后——\n我也想一直和你并肩前行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a06ade094829db3be3c4e36efee0f9c5802741b164169fa0deda11b1a60b1b8d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ceafefd2e042ccfec8a1220",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我带了冰镇的艾兰过来，\n之后要不要一起喝？\n口感清爽，会让人凉快下来哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "938149888095fa6913b56585f0a3f14b215b29c5e60d0a3a91aca43477fe8c5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d1d25762478a239c3cb9f62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "与你连结的希望之环——就在这里…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8790d28669156a5c339283854f6489da5d215ba06b3fde7b3cdeeadd80327d19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3334578236e47fd2a0a37a14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是否贴近了大家的心呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "55a33c07c692f9b2ab47800504bcd0903eb5171f23929b32620db030a4bc8d14",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbd9b6ab0df4a502dfccd714",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要连结到进一步的成长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94a0e1e8a5cfb9ea26e60414ac69357982f71b1dac5d929b804a7ddde4bd4c1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04f15577ffa4df2e3f5d407f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "希望，就在极限的彼方——",
      "source_fingerprint": "7648e711f869ff2f8837ce3bc1098cd48c079a715d59da2d24e60245deb76c43",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b661556a43a2112489b29dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是比萨胜驹。请多关照。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49b1b2b68509a73bcd94a241df6f8c682c1964de3d19397c23b8668aea265531",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8181bb53b51cda9fb52f3f84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，让我们连结起来。\n用你与我——连结希望之环。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdc459abc92791c0588b61048c1f1c4e0e0f3b41ef38871a5c6eaa7753581447",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f81a38dfe38f248261f191ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "连结成更大的圆环——",
      "source_fingerprint": "57fdc874cc838df81d9378f2eb1536074352fcaf4ccb0c37410bf0fd8ea07971",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:865d724e9945a7bfcf3bbc08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用最佳着法拿下胜利吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b3e0fc10da02f00fb50aec7f9bb2af7f31f1f954907e08756c48a875a55a8e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da32dff8c0e0173ce7385a4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你未免有点太谦虚了……多拿出点\n自信来。你可是既有伯乐之才又有\n绝佳辅助能力的我的“左膀右臂”啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f1feaa5f8ab45cab1400e1d650b01fcb9d69f43f514df9cb1cfab35d0450562",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1547894f6ef9f84e450c27d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b1438d935e276af64ada2c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60e47dc0696478b983169681",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你虽然是我的左膀右臂，但在这之前\n更是网游固玩……所以提个建议。\n周末晚上要不要跟我一起线上通宵？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd29182983b25232b4924c71bc830dcd29e343b14435ddec9c4e58af7bac5d63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff6e1f63f1bc4d744d796e26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你的弱点在于迟钝呢。不，某种意义上\r\n也算优势……？――呵，反正无论如何\r\n我都会将此考虑在内，制定出策略的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa2e78b4eb779faf172e86900d08921963d73787934e64881a6d8d931008ec7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8bb4b3c76b0954dfea57d70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "缩在被炉里睡懒觉度过新年是唯一正解。\n然后再玩玩桌游，新年假期瞬间就蒸发了……\n话说这假期不够吧？真想再放两周啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5114622a3faaaa1369e6c558dab0cbb05ffa43a43655b8d98b1ed49c1201abd6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7728e43f65316243ac099ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你如果有事找我，我姑且听听看……\n…………今天可是情人节哦？面对憧憬的\ndomi大佬，你看……难道不表示点什么吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6766486fd71080e1f28c254d27b80f2d2325665ea7cbf620348635d286ed1e8d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54ef74bef0269c1ea56b0cbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比起巧克力，我更想送你一副国际象棋。\r\n比起一时的甘甜，能长久下下去的\r\n对局才更有价值，不是吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "06d8db2385e3a80f828d45d85937aea72d3853e3e410eb748400f1f24eceeaa2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0102c16167da5b8315274fa0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我挺喜欢银河的。那种壮丽宏大，\r\n任谁都会为之心动吧。希望今年\r\n也能看得到……在实况摄像头里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41b26868f2fb90380b945b6d91cd223fa1ce3d1782f64595fd2678415ad2aa83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dc8f372d7680906ec82f96c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奇迹说我很适合暗黑奇幻风\r\n里的吸血鬼角色。\r\n呵……难得今天，要不就穿穿看？",
      "source_fingerprint": "19ea38cb1aa96d761a81b3acf6b45668d5b2856685c50b6d90ccda8faa7ac8f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2871062a4028e66e980b05a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我收到的第一份圣诞礼物是黑白棋。\r\n当时一心想着要怎么才能打败父亲，\r\n完全沉迷其中了呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f05127f83f217c1dc2a7acba4d9e6a873a59adb10c6c44cf0c3667f1d710fcdd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bcd932c60bed4ab679c8175",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "毕竟圣诞节时街上太吵了啊。\r\n窝在房间里削减成本才是最优解……\r\n一边下国际象棋，一边庆祝这个夜晚吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b770a7f99d43f2a2059b15167529733c6972c4742ff7ca2eb2aa36ec949848b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6136a6f088b0345335f9a0d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正如我所料。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c0245a0ac04d9830af075e2590882ab2d357a895e37058dcd02888cbf8adebc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:102115b51cfaf2770851cb90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "打扫卫生效率最关键……这跟围棋的\n『脱先』是一个道理。省去不必要的\n一手，用最少的回合收拾干净。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b994534cab4543b9e2f8a9431a6f02f4a0b4fe1e1271a144a46161f9003ac5e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bab1d44c1d04df6aefae063",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然想用生日蛋糕给你庆祝……\r\n但有个条件。桌游上先赢我\r\n一局试试看。赢不了就不放你回去哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c86e33e54b0be5bd4190e3bd367666b0556140e341f0d5010551c774ebf0b5ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec4aa1377ebb1103f96acc69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天出门吧，我已经订好晚餐厅了。\r\n……呵，惊讶什么呢。\r\n毕竟是你的生日，这不是理所当然的吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d5cd98c24e51c43c8a0ceff7831c138663af371b36bc296e54312e90583a380",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5518107c3b1ba9b916c40de1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比萨她们好像要给我办生日会呢。\r\n难得有机会，就在我的根据地\r\n把那些重策积压游戏清一清吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d14d7becdd3cb383bacf6923b3ee89d5dcc76d6b6feb7bd2b9e171b5f65718c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a615ef6d9fd37aded118dfa7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我都到了不必为过生日而大喜过望的\n年纪了……但你看起来好像\n很想给我庆祝呢？呵，随你喜欢吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ba2c5ed3435646309ff49527ac5cceba9c7e525af11e66b77e3e8d780b5fcd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f886dc3b09281ca37cd64387",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像收到通知了。\r\n赶紧过目一遍吧，\r\n搞定之后就来下黑白棋。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e430eeb2e5a457567feb720c1db9faa1c0854f4c8fdef3cc3f586f1240bffd27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d69ee12393ef5ec45d8342fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "似乎有礼物送到了。\r\n这些成果记得好好珍惜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "876a3e01a5d5343dd1d92fd8d3f06f77afd461d51b2bf975f7c7d3065fce7488",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c40f9536310a493d3c3ed18a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成。\r\n这招用得挺巧妙的嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "478e8e567e157eb772aed32380a9bc3cd8b4df9b139eaf6ac4365df5c2c3e88a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8bce603a51872798e32d529",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有活动呢。\r\n如果是线上举办的话，我就去参战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "808dbaa64e51dee5137baf28ec59afc490b059387939aeb18887534109e246d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbbb3ff18aa2e5b87fe494b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵――活动是吧……\r\n罢了，这种程度的局面，\r\n我轻易就能掌控。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c14ffe7fffc87a673b046f94195729eaebe3d7c0902b6a43930cfe9ad4c33215",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f19adcb2dbaec322b8dc7489",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次一定会赢……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "919c42e944016d145f42035bdd04ece9da52dc5c002d7d3766053f012ff05f2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39687e69437102c178cd65b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名册等级提升了呢。\r\n你果然很有天赋。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f41637c81c9ca98bf2744303f4679ca4855179387636028dc0eea0efd1754f51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adaa4104564acef7cffa690a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服是我常买的品牌哦。\r\n随性又舒适，同时也不失\r\n摩登都市的气息对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b06f3bc14252809c999ce2cb933ad243d8cd1eeb8dd6218a4ff5f7f062ddd7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2a222ee47d28f3f641e743d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "衍生版狼人杀里有些特殊身份。\r\n尤其是幽灵牌，非常有意思哦。\r\n把所有人玩弄于股掌之间赢得胜利的那一刻超爽的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b21e755714b650ac1f922e3751e5478d9c1612eb863580dd873de3be87348f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf33543856a7824ad4909764",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "外出容量这种东西是有限度的……\r\n一周一次就是极限……要不是特别有价值的正事，\r\n我连这一次都懒得出门……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e0baf63f51ab46c098a7b2c81290acc1beb56d9828d0ec79553ffdcf61b708a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9de978574f04fcceaa81b8ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很有趣的对局。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a56ee15e01588ecf1fef01292b2072e9ccad318fee94df07de39ab51ae45db44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b452d88aaf4f6695445e0425",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "摆出这种阵型，赢是理所当然的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "13fe78dd719f38309214eeec155bc9fbc43c765ed81926c81b5d603be0c074ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6edd70e60995dd204024402c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次一定会赢……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "919c42e944016d145f42035bdd04ece9da52dc5c002d7d3766053f012ff05f2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d962c81f18f92201aeeb141a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很有趣的对局。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a56ee15e01588ecf1fef01292b2072e9ccad318fee94df07de39ab51ae45db44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe22e2084b036b221f963de1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刷新记录了……拿下了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8bfa3841eb2ca92804d66d679c5e56486283e45951c97511cbfff54945db31c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdddf7744ded154b91bba4a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，来对局一把吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "773ecd63b1694007765b4f6f95bf369b2ccffa349f5936bae40f7a3543a2b8cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a3d6b94200c8de7785713ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49c60d7d8e006825fca83d48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是训练啊。首先\r\n从讲解菜单规则开始吧。\r\n我会完美执行完成给你看的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc7cba57e97cc9edecf199bee56f50f65c9e34f516c254ba0493c225a8dfec00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa5eb24d51436c5072f436b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "向前人学习，也是非常重要的视角呢。\r\n即使在博弈中，过去名手的妙手\r\n也有许多值得汲取的地方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4849a19b606258a605099740dba4a40f34e4d4a4bf89e741778b830e8646d527",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:433791624bf4f569f47d6196",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要下一局吗？\r\n好，接下来该用什么阵型\r\n去拿下胜局呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9724afa536b38f0ab9181cccb02efbde76fd391249891d4f3eb6d842401de0a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "110002"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
